    "title": "Phone Dialer - Call Recorder",
    "description": "Are you tired of boring phone dialer? Smart phone calling app is here for you to make phone calls fast. Enjoy calls with friends and family using the phone dialer app. \r\n\r\nPhone call dialer and dial pad is a fast dialer for android. Contacts Search and dial calls using the phone calling app. Call logs can be viewed with caller ID and phone app. Improve your phone calling experience with the phone dialer app. Phone number search using the call screen app. Use the phone call dialer app to view smart contacts and phone call history. Phone number lookup with contact manager and smartphone dialer.\r\n\r\nPhone call dialer is a telephone app used as Dialpad. Maintain call logs and access contacts using the phone app. Phone dialer app to manage call list and call history. You can add phone contacts to favorites. Phone Dialer app has the feature of a quick dial pad. Check recent contacts and call screen with a Phone dialer for android. Access contacts from the phone book with the true caller app.\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\n\u2713Call dialer - Dial calls with Simple Call Dialer\r\n\u2713Call logs - View phone call history\r\n\u2713Contacts search - Easily search contact by name\r\n\u2713Phone dialer \u2013 No need for the internet to dial calls\r\n\u2713Theme - Apply the theme to the photo dialer app\r\n\u2713Phone Dialpad - Check recent call log\r\n\r\n<b>Access Recent Calls and Contacts</b>\r\nDial numbers using contacts and the telephone dialer app. Phone number search with phone call dialer app. A phone calling app is used for phone number lookup. Add favorite contacts and easily call them with one tap. Check recent calls and dial numbers using the dial pad app. Phone number lookup using caller ID app. Search or manage your contacts book with the phone calling app.\r\n\r\n<b>Dialpad and Contacts Manager</b>\r\nThe phone calling app has a customization feature. Everyone can customize the call screen and caller ID. Customize the dial pad background of the android phone. Add your favorite contacts and easily phone call contacts. Dial pad and Contacts Manager app to view the phonebook list. Phone dial pad to view recent contacts. Phone calling app to view call logs, call history, incoming calls, and missed calls.\r\n\r\n<b>Manage Call Log</b>\r\nTrue caller app to view contacts list. Avoid unknown calls using the phone call dialer app. Phone number search using a simple call dialer app. Manage your calls with a phone dialer. Default dialer to view recent phone calls, phone numbers, and contacts. Phone dialer and caller id app help in phone number lookup and call history. \r\n\r\n<b>Phone call dialer</b>\r\nBlock numbers and add them to the blacklist using the phone call app. Phone dial pad photo wallpaper app to block numbers. Block spam callers and stay away from fraudsters, spam calls, and robocalls. Phone number search with phone calling app. Dark themes are available for speed dial. Phone book app can add contacts to a favorite list. Phone call dialer app helps to avoid spammers, telemarketers, scammers, and fraud.\r\n\r\n<b>Smart phone dialer</b>\r\nOffline phone calling dialer app used to save numbers to your phone book. True caller app works as a phonebook and dial pad. Access Contacts using a simple phone dialer and call app. View Recent Calls with the cell phone dialer app. Smart dialer app for contact merge, delete, and rename. Manage contacts with a Fast phone dialer. A simple Phone dialer and call app help to add contacts to your favorite list.\r\n\r\nGive five-star rating to the Phone call dialer app. Give feedback at dev@pocketclubs.com. Your positive feedback encourages us to improve.",
